# Brand icon

Same mark as the web and native apps: **opaque square**, art inset ~10% so a squircle mask does not clip the moon/star, clipped in CSS.

- File: `app_icon.png` (Twilight variant — this page is always dark).
- Shape: `border-radius: 22.37%` and `corner-shape: squircle` on `.logo`. **Not** `border-radius: 50%`.
- Do not circle-crop, pre-round, or scale the art to the PNG edges.

To change the illustration, replace `lumina-web/public/brand/icon-master.png` and run `npm run icons` there. Keep the CSS clip; only the art changes.
